en as young people and as a church\r\n[38:05 - 38:09] We simply come to you the vine for a strength and for sustenance\r\n[38:09 - 38:15] We abide in you. Thank you Lord. You will be glorified. We praise you in Jesus name. Amen\r\n[38:17 - 38:36] Amen, okay, if you'd like to say your memory verse come on up Romans 8 44 B\r\n\n","truncated_fields":["content"]}
